<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="_aua9JQK"><p xml:id="_8TQpY29" coords="1,50.00,173.49,332.99,9.90">We describe a benign synthetic study of reproducible document processing.</p></div>
