	<text xml:lang="en">
		<body>
<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="_jBBvdjb"><p xml:id="_vqcVkQR" coords="1,50.00,213.44,79.72,12.60;1,50.00,243.49,331.14,9.90">1 Introduction Document processing requires explicit provenance and preserved originals.</p><p xml:id="_gJEwvuy" coords="1,50.00,264.49,316.18,9.90">Example and Sample (2024) describe a controlled validation procedure.</p><p xml:id="_snJRvBj" coords="1,50.00,285.49,326.28,9.90">The present study measures a local CPU service with no metadata lookup.</p></div>
<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><head n="2" xml:id="_AhKm23b" coords="1,50.00,304.44,59.50,12.60">Methods</head><p xml:id="_qHrz2aF" coords="1,50.00,334.49,336.33,9.90">We generated two pages containing a title, abstract, methods and references.</p><p xml:id="_4GssTyW" coords="1,50.00,355.49,316.14,9.90">All paragraphs and reference records were written for this software test.</p><p xml:id="_WkMfjs8" coords="1,50.00,376.49,331.45,9.90">The original bytes remain unchanged during repeated structured extraction.</p></div>
<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><head n="3" xml:id="_tumtpEw" coords="2,50.00,52.44,51.73,12.60">Results</head><p xml:id="_M6HtnMa" coords="2,50.00,82.49,315.87,9.90">The experiment reports cold and warm service request times separately.</p><p xml:id="_GR8H8mp" coords="2,50.00,103.49,325.35,9.90">A successful request is not a claim of exhaustive text or citation accuracy.</p><p xml:id="_3VSPXtJ" coords="2,50.00,124.49,329.92,9.90">The CPU runtime returns page surfaces and region coordinates in raw TEI.</p></div>
<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><head n="4" xml:id="_ytTcgsp" coords="2,50.00,143.44,71.95,12.60">Discussion</head><p xml:id="_Ztznf5z" coords="2,50.00,173.49,303.37,9.90">Learned extraction can omit or misclassify synthetic scholarly fields.</p><p xml:id="_nh8fz8N" coords="2,50.00,194.49,319.24,9.90">Raw evidence is retained so that downstream projections can be audited.</p></div>		</body>
